      "statement": "`fetchRosterRows` pages the `learners` table 1000 rows at a time until a short page arrives, ordered by `last_name`, `first_name`, `id`, because the API caps a response at 1000 rows and silently drops the rest — a school past that boundary would otherwise export its first thousand scholars with no error anywhere.",
